OL,3,GNEWSARecord year for Robin Hood half
OL,4,Amarathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 15,000 runners have taken part
OL,7,Fin this year's Robin Hood Half
OL,8,FMarathon, in the event's largest
OL,9,Fturnout yet.
OL,11,FThe 13.1mile (21km) race took place on
OL,12,FSunday in Nottingham city centre.
OL,14,FThe runners included Darren Coates, 45,
OL,15,Fwho completed the race in memory of his
OL,16,Ffather, Ian, the school caretaker
OL,17,Fkilled during the Nottingham attacks.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
